      Kirill. First, I want to congratulate you on this wonderful event. Our viewers
      have a few questions; may I ask them?","$type":"System.String"},"HideFace":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"HideName":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-4010.0,"y":-143.0},"guid":"72d2f84c-04fb-4ce4-8f18-fff5b08f5d6f","$version":"A","$type":"VSMessageCharUnit","$id":"33"},{"defaultValues":{"Avatar":null,"Name":{"$content":"News","$type":"System.String"},"NameColor":{"r":1.0,"g":1.0,"b":1.0,"a":1.0,"$type":"UnityEngine.Color"}},"position":{"x":-328.0,"y":-123.0},"guid":"20323ecc-6c82-4e15-b6de-58703aec8bca","$version":"A","$type":"VSMessageArrayUnit","$id":"35"},{"nest":{"source":"Macro","macro":12,"embed":null},"defaultValues":{"ID":{"$content":"","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":4523.0,"y":763.0},"guid":"09b92a8c-4230-4554-b71d-0d5ba9a4e8fe","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"37"},{"defaultValues":{"Name":{"$content":13,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"},"Message":{"$content":"As
      we all know, your journey began with the purchase of RenPy Corp, and after
      launching many successful projects your conglomerate grew to include companies
      like RockStar and Nvidia. Tell us, what goals were you pursuing when you bought
      all those companies?","$type":"System.String"},"HideFace":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"HideName":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":-3230.0,"y":-146.0},"guid":"d5ffbef4-454a-4c46-aa6e-b614416c5259","$version":"A","$type":"VSMessageCharUnit","$id":"40"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["audio"],"member":{"name":"PlayBackgroundAudio","parameterTypes":["UnityEngine.Audio.AudioResource"],"targetType":"GlobalDirector","targetTypeName":"GlobalDirector","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"%audio":{"$content":14,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"}},"position":{"x":-6454.0,"y":-189.0},"guid":"59e98c80-eec8-490a-bca8-a26e5d3f9d48","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"42"},{"nest":{"source":"Macro","macro":15,"embed":null},"defaultValues":{"Char":{"$content":16,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"},"Message":{"$content":"Kirill
      has changed a lot lately. It is like he has become obsessed with something...","$type":"System.String"},"HideFace":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"},"HideName":{"$content":false,"$type":"System.Boolean"}},"position":{"x":7344.0,"y":-181.0},"guid":"987b33fe-6c63-4846-bddc-42683f437777","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"46"},{"defaultValues":{"Name":{"$content":17,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"},"Message":{"$content":"We
